In reference to captioned subject, we hereby inform you that the Board of Directors of the Company, in their Board Meeting held on today, i.e. on November 02, 2026, which was commenced at 05:00 P.M. and concluded at 05:35 P.M., have, apart from other businesses, considered, approved and taken on record the Unaudited Financial Results of the Company for the half year ended September 30, 2026 along with Limited Review Report.
In this regards we are hereby submitting following:
a) Unaudited Financial Results for the half year ended on September 30, 2026;

b) Limited Review Report issued by Statutory Auditor;

c) Certificate of statutory auditors for object wise utilization of the IPO issue proceeds.
